    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Crank outcomes",
      "description": "The coarse view: sent, no_work, skipped, failed. no_work is the designed cheap path for a conservative wake hint and costs only a local simulation \u2014 but a high no_work rate next to a low sent rate means the hints are firing far too often.",
