    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RPC latency p99 by method",
      "description": "The other half of a slow tick: time spent waiting on a provider rather than doing work. get_multiple_accounts climbing here, together with uncovered cache reads, is the case for another --watch-program. get_program_accounts is the registry refresh and scales with the whole registry, not just this turner's share.",
