    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Confirmation latency p99 \u2014 cluster latency",
      "description": "Submission to settlement, split from wake lag on purpose: 'we were slow to decide' and 'the cluster was slow to confirm' are different problems with different fixes. A rising expired series means transactions are not landing inside a blockhash's life and the priority fee is too low.",
