      "title": "Compute units p99 by stage",
      "description": "The cost side of the same question. A resolver whose CU keeps climbing will eventually stop fitting in a packed transaction, and packing is what makes several cranks share one signature fee \u2014 so this is the early warning for a fee increase that has no other cause.",
