  "description": "Relay crank turner. Rows answer, in order: what is generating load, where the time is going, whether the work pays for itself, and whether the plumbing is healthy. Every panel carries a description explaining what a bad shape looks like \u2014 hover the (i). Label cardinality is deliberately bounded: programs are labelled by an 8-character prefix and conditions are not labelled at all, so per-condition drilldown belongs in the `relay` CLI, not here."
